      "id": "claim_779986194bf84a1c805492c586c4e3f1",
      "statement": "The arXiv Research Copilot is a cited Q&A assistant over 250 arXiv cs.AI abstracts whose primary deliverable is the surrounding evaluation system: a human-reviewed golden set, evaluators, and experiment decision gates organized around Barnett et al.'s seven RAG failure points.",
