    {
      "id": "claim_451bd473a6704e1bac26b4ecac18d5b6",
      "statement": "The corpus is frozen by resources/corpus_manifest.json (250 arXiv ids with per-abstract sha1 digests, versioned in git); rebuilds fetch by id, verify every digest, and fail loudly on missing or revised abstracts, while the parquet caches are git-ignored rebuildables.",
